cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the method it implements, please cite the paper."
title: "Native Context Editing: a grammar of dedicated special tokens for editing an LLM agent's own context"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Native Context Editing (NCE). The context is an
  ordered list of addressable blocks; the model emits edits written in a grammar
  of dedicated special tokens, and a task-agnostic runtime executes them at the
  end of the turn. This repository ships the grammar, the runtime, the annotation
  reference implementation, and worked examples. It does not include the paper's
  training stack or data.
